; BLUS30826
; Yakuza: Dead Souls (USA)
; Built by richard1222/Yakuza-dead-souls-cheats
;
; Code values: Game Genie For PS3 & krustytoe, with the 9999/9999 HP code
; from www55.atwiki.jp and the difficulty codes from savedata.jp.
; This file's layout is ours; the code values are the original set.
;
; STATUS: none of these is verified on hardware yet. Test order is in
; VERIFY_SAVEPATCH.md. Apply with Apollo Save Tool.
;
; Target file: USER01

:USER01

[GROUP:Money and progression]
[Max Money]
; 999,999,999. Single 32-bit write -- the region test.
20008B48 3B9AC9FF

[Max EXP]
; 99,999,999.
2001CAFC 05F5E0FF

[Max Soul Points]
; 8-bit write (255). Watch neighbouring bytes.
0001CB06 000000FF

[Level 98]
; 32-bit write at an ODD offset 0x01CA01. Also zeroes 0x01CA03-04. Most
; uncertain code in the set.
2001ca01 00000062

[GROUP:Casino and minigame counters]
[Max Casino Chips]
20008B4C 05F5E0FF

[Max Wooden Tag]
20008B50 05f5E0FF

[Max Mahjong Sticks]
20008B54 05F5E0FF

[Max PachinKO Balls]
20008B74 05F5E0FF

[Max Slots Token]
; 999,999 (0x0098967F), not 99,999,999 -- differs from its neighbours.
20008B78 0098967F

[Max Zombies Reward Points]
20008B7C 05F5E0FF

[GROUP:Health]
[9999/9999 HP]
; Current and max HP in one dword. Upstream notes the runtime equivalent
; affects enemies too.
2001CAE4 270F270F

[GROUP:Difficulty Modifier (Choose One)]
; All four write the same address 0x14. The last one applied wins.
[Normal]
10000014 00000101

[Hard]
10000014 00000202

[Ex-Hard]
10000014 00000303

[Dead Souls/Of The End]
10000014 00000404

[GROUP:Inventory]
